    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "(2/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>Skriv följande längder i enheten meter, med svaret i grundpotensform.</p>\n<ol><li>6,2 nm</li><li>24 Gm</li><li>3,4·10³ km</li><li>155 pm</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Nano betyder \\(10^{-9}\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[6{,}2\\ \\mathrm{nm}=6{,}2\\cdot10^{-9}\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Giga betyder \\(10^9\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[24\\ \\mathrm{Gm}=24\\cdot10^9=2{,}4\\cdot10^{10}\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">En kilometer är \\(10^3\\) meter.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[3{,}4\\cdot10^3\\ \\mathrm{km}=3{,}4\\cdot10^6\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Piko betyder \\(10^{-12}\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[155\\ \\mathrm{pm}=155\\cdot10^{-12}=1{,}55\\cdot10^{-10}\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(6{,}2\\cdot10^{-9}\\ \\mathrm m\\), \\(2{,}4\\cdot10^{10}\\ \\mathrm m\\), \\(3{,}4\\cdot10^6\\ \\mathrm m\\) och \\(1{,}55\\cdot10^{-10}\\ \\mathrm m\\).</p></div>",
    "familj": "Prefix och tiopotenser",
