    "poang": "(1/1/0)",
    "t": "<p>Mätpunkterna visar hur massan beror på volymen för ett ämne.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"480\" height=\"323\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 350\" style=\"display:block;width:480px;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:323px;margin:12px auto\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Massa och volym med spridda mätpunkter\"><title>Massa och volym med spridda mätpunkter</title><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">0</text><line x1=\"114.375\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"114.375\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"114.375\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">5</text><line x1=\"163.75\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"163.75\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"163.75\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">10</text><line x1=\"213.125\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"213.125\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"213.125\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">15</text><line x1=\"262.5\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"262.5\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"262.5\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">20</text><line x1=\"311.875\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"311.875\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"311.875\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">25</text><line x1=\"361.25\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"361.25\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"361.25\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">30</text><line x1=\"410.625\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"410.625\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"410.625\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">35</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">40</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"279\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">0</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"246.875\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"246.875\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"250.875\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">5</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"218.75\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"218.75\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"222.75\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">10</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"190.625\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"190.625\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"194.625\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">15</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"162.5\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"162.5\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"166.5\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">20</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"134.375\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"134.375\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"138.375\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">25</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"106.25\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"106.25\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"110.25\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">30</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"78.125\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"78.125\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"82.125\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">35</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"54\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">40</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"463\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#293747\">Massa (g)</text><text x=\"462\" y=\"329\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">Volym (cm³)</text><circle cx=\"112.4\" cy=\"264.14375\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"155.85\" cy=\"225.16250000000002\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"203.25\" cy=\"199.7375\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"250.65\" cy=\"195.6875\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"298.05000000000007\" cy=\"164.46875\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"345.45\" cy=\"160.25\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"392.85\" cy=\"118.90625\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"436.3\" cy=\"107.20625000000001\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/></svg></span><p>a) Bestäm ämnets densitet.</p><p>b) En provbit av ämnet har massan 24 g. Uppskatta dess volym.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Massa och volym hänger ihop genom m = ρV. Densiteten är därför lutningen i ett massa–volym-diagram. Anpassa en rät linje genom origo som följer hela mätserien. Använd två punkter på linjen, inte två godtyckliga mätpunkter.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\rho=\\frac{\\Delta m}{\\Delta V}\\approx\\frac{24-0}{30-0}=0{,}8\\ \\mathrm{g/cm^3}\\]</div><p>Avläsningen är ungefärlig. Lite olika lutningar är rimliga eftersom mätpunkterna har en tydlig spridning.</p></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Lös ut volymen ur m = ρV. Använd samma densitet som i del a.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[V=\\frac m\\rho\\approx\\frac{24}{0{,}80}=30\\ \\mathrm{cm^3}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Cirka 0,80 g/cm³ och 30 cm³.</p></div>",
    "familj": "Densitet ur diagram och mätdata",
    "formaga": [
      "procedur"
    ],
    "familjNyckel": "densitet__densitet_fran_diagram_och_matdata",
