    "poang": "(0/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>Diagrammet visar en mätserie för massa och volym.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"480\" height=\"323\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 350\" style=\"display:block;width:480px;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:323px;margin:12px auto\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Massa och volym med spridda mätpunkter\"><title>Massa och volym med spridda mätpunkter</title><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">0</text><line x1=\"121.42857142857142\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"121.42857142857142\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"121.42857142857142\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">4</text><line x1=\"177.85714285714283\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"177.85714285714283\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"177.85714285714283\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">8</text><line x1=\"234.28571428571428\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"234.28571428571428\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"234.28571428571428\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">12</text><line x1=\"290.71428571428567\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"290.71428571428567\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"290.71428571428567\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">16</text><line x1=\"347.14285714285717\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"347.14285714285717\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"347.14285714285717\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">20</text><line x1=\"403.57142857142856\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"403.57142857142856\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"403.57142857142856\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">24</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"297\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#293747\">28</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"279\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">0</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"246.875\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"246.875\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"250.875\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">10</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"218.75\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"218.75\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"222.75\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">20</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"190.625\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"190.625\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"194.625\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">30</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"162.5\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"162.5\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"166.5\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">40</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"134.375\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"134.375\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"138.375\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">50</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"106.25\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"106.25\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"110.25\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">60</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"78.125\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"78.125\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"82.125\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">70</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#dde5eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"54\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">80</text><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"463\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#293747\">Massa (g)</text><text x=\"462\" y=\"329\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#293747\">Volym (cm³)</text><circle cx=\"112.96428571428572\" cy=\"240.18125\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"155.28571428571428\" cy=\"235.709375\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"203.25\" cy=\"216.696875\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"251.21428571428572\" cy=\"174.59375\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"297.7678571428571\" cy=\"161.825\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"345.73214285714283\" cy=\"123.49062500000002\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"392.2857142857143\" cy=\"122.05624999999998\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><circle cx=\"436.01785714285717\" cy=\"87.96875\" r=\"3.7\" fill=\"#42789c\" stroke=\"#42789c\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/></svg></span><p>a) Bestäm ämnets densitet.</p><p>b) Förklara varför densiteten motsvarar lutningen i just detta diagram.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Massa och volym hänger ihop genom m = ρV. Densiteten är därför lutningen i ett massa–volym-diagram. Anpassa en rät linje genom origo som följer hela mätserien. Använd två punkter på linjen, inte två godtyckliga mätpunkter.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\rho=\\frac{\\Delta m}{\\Delta V}\\approx\\frac{50-0}{20-0}=2{,}5\\ \\mathrm{g/cm^3}\\]</div><p>Avläsningen är ungefärlig. Lite olika lutningar är rimliga eftersom mätpunkterna har en tydlig spridning.</p></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">När volymen ökar med ΔV ökar massan med ρΔV. Lutningen Δm/ΔV är därför lika med ρ. Axelns gramenhet delad med cm³ ger densitetsenheten g/cm³.</p></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Cirka 2,5 g/cm³.</p></div>",
