    "poang": "(1/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>En massiv metallcylinder har diametern 3,0 cm, höjden 8,0 cm och massan 507 g. Bestäm materialets densitet i g/cm³.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"520\" height=\"290\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 290\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cylinder med diameter och höjd\"><title>Cylinder med diameter och höjd</title><path d=\"M135 65 L135 190 A65 19 0 0 0 265 190 L265 65\" fill=\"#e5eff6\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"200\" cy=\"65\" rx=\"65\" ry=\"19\" fill=\"#cbdde9\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M135 190 A65 19 0 0 1 265 190\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#788a99\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><line x1=\"135\" y1=\"237\" x2=\"265\" y2=\"237\" stroke=\"#788a99\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"135\" y1=\"242\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#788a99\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"265\" y1=\"242\" x2=\"265\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#788a99\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#293747\">d = 3,0 cm</text><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#788a99\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"295\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#788a99\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"295\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#788a99\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#293747\"></text><text x=\"315\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#293747\">8,0 cm</text></svg></span><p>Svara med två decimaler.</p>",
    "s": "<p>Radien är 1,5 cm. Volymen är \\(\\pi\\cdot1{,}5^2\\cdot8=18\\pi\\) cm³. Densiteten blir \\(507/(18\\pi)\\approx8{,}97\\) g/cm³.</p>",
    "familj": "Densitet med geometri",
