    "id": "3.29",
    "kap": 3,
    "omr": "konstacc",
    "niva": "C",
    "typ": "bestamma total restid for en rorelse i tre faser nar hela strackan ar given, ur text, sokt tid",
    "poang": "(0/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>Ett tåg lämnar station A från vila och accelererar likformigt med 0,60 m/s² tills det når farten 24 m/s. Därefter håller det farten konstant. Till sist bromsar det likformigt med 0,80 m/s² och står stilla precis vid station B. Avståndet mellan stationerna är 2,4 km.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"190\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 18.142 470.000 143.794\"><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"112.5\" x2=\"456\" y2=\"112.5\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"36\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"68\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"68\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"84\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"84\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"116\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"148\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"164\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"196\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"212\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"212\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"228\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"244\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"276\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"276\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"292\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"292\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"308\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"324\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"324\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"356\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"372\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"372\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"388\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"388\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"404\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"404\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"420\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"436\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"452\" y1=\"113.5\" x2=\"452\" y2=\"119.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><path d=\"M 107.2 108 L 107.2 67.7 L 133.2 67.7 L 141 74.2 L 151.4 74.2 L 151.4 108 Z\" fill=\"#E5EDF4\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"74.2\" width=\"37.7\" height=\"33.8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"65.6\" y=\"74.2\" width=\"37.7\" height=\"33.8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"117.6\" cy=\"108\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"141\" cy=\"108\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"35.6\" cy=\"108\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"57.7\" cy=\"108\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"77.2\" cy=\"108\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"99.3\" cy=\"108\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"108\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"452\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"452\" y2=\"108\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">station A</text><text x=\"452\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">station B</text><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"136.5\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"136.5\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"22,136.5 29,139.5 29,133.5\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><polygon points=\"450,136.5 443,139.5 443,133.5\" fill=\"#5C575E\"/><text x=\"236\" y=\"152.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">2,4 km</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">accelererar → konstant 24 m/s → bromsar</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm hela restiden i s.</p>",
    "s": "<p>Accelerationen tar 24/0,60 = 40 s och sträckan är 24²/(2 · 0,60) = 480 m. Inbromsningen tar 24/0,80 = 30 s och 360 m. Kvar för konstant fart är 2400 − 480 − 360 = 1560 m, vilket tar 1560/24 = 65 s. Totalt 40 + 65 + 30 = 135 s.</p>",
    "familj": "Sträcka vid konstant acceleration",
    "formaga": [
      "problemlösning"
    ],
    "familjNyckel": "konstacc__konstant_acceleration",
