        "t": "<p>Ett flygplan startar från vila och lyfter vid farten 68 m/s efter att ha rullat sträckan i figuren.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"159\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 29.508 430.000 110.041\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"92\" width=\"410\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><polygon points=\"36,60 32,36 50,60\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"74,72 62,86 86,86 94,72\" fill=\"#DCE6F2\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"34\" y=\"58\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"120,58 134,68 120,78\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"67\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#9A959C\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"67\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#9A959C\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"67\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#9A959C\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"67\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"#9A959C\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"52\" cy=\"88\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"106\" cy=\"88\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"146\" y1=\"73\" x2=\"196\" y2=\"73\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><polygon points=\"206,73 196,77.6 196,68.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"221\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = 68 m/s</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"123\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"133\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"410\" y1=\"123\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"133\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1156 m</text></svg></span><p>Anta konstant acceleration. Den första startsträckan är 1156 m.</p><p>Bestäm startsträckan för 78 m/s vid samma acceleration i m.</p>",
