    "t": "<p>En vagn rör sig enligt diagrammet.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"470\" height=\"270\" viewBox=\"0 0 470 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hastighet–tid-diagram\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"white\"/><line x1=\"45.00\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"45.00\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"72.14\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"72.14\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"99.29\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"99.29\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"126.43\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"126.43\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"153.57\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"153.57\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"180.71\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"180.71\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"207.86\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"207.86\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"235.00\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"235.00\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"262.14\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"262.14\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"289.29\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"289.29\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"316.43\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"316.43\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"343.57\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"343.57\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"370.71\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"370.71\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"397.86\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"397.86\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"425.00\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"425.00\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"225.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"225.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"205.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"205.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"185.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"185.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"165.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"165.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"145.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"145.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"125.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"125.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"105.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"105.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"85.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"85.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"65.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"65.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"45.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"45.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"185.0\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"185.0\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"45.0\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"45.0\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polyline points=\"45.0,45.0 262.1,45.0 262.1,225.0 425.0,225.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#176b87\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\">t (s)</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\">v (m/s)</text><text x=\"45.00\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">0</text><text x=\"99.29\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1</text><text x=\"153.57\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">2</text><text x=\"207.86\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">3</text><text x=\"262.14\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">4</text><text x=\"316.43\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">5</text><text x=\"370.71\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">6</text><text x=\"425.00\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">7</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"229.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">−2</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"209.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">−1</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"189.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">0</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"169.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"149.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">2</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"129.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">3</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"109.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">4</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"89.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">5</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"69.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">6</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"49.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">7</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm kvoten mellan hela vägsträckan och förflyttningens storlek under 0–7 s. Svara med tre decimaler.</p>",
    "s": "<p>Framåtsträckan är 7 · 4 = 28 m och bakåtsträckan 2 · 3 = 6 m. Vägsträckan är 34 m och förflyttningens belopp 22 m. Kvoten är 34/22 ≈ 1,545.</p>",
