        "t": "<p>En färja ska korsa en 240 m bred älv. Farten genom vattnet är konstant 3,0 m/s och strömmen håller 1,2 m/s parallellt med stränderna.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"337\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 250\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"460\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"60\" width=\"460\" height=\"140\" fill=\"#DCE6F2\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"200\" width=\"460\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#ECEFF3\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"392,100 383,104.6 383,95.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"352\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">strömmen</text><polygon points=\"106,193 134,193 128,205 112,205\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"193\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"119\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"120,109 124.6,119 115.4,119\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">3,0 m/s</text><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"199\" x2=\"144\" y2=\"199\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"154,199 144,203.6 144,194.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"216\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1,2 m/s</text><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"199\" x2=\"154\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><line x1=\"48\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"43\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"53\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"43\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"53\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">240 m</text></svg></span><p>Färjan riktas vinkelrätt mot stranden genom vattnet. Hur långt driver den nedströms under överfarten? Svara i m.</p>",
