    "typ": "skilja sträcka från förflyttning i v-t-diagram",
    "poang": "(0/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>En vagn rör sig enligt diagrammet.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"470\" height=\"270\" viewBox=\"0 0 470 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hastighet–tid-diagram\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"white\"/><line x1=\"45.00\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"45.00\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"92.50\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"92.50\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"140.00\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140.00\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"187.50\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"187.50\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"235.00\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"235.00\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"282.50\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"282.50\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"330.00\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"330.00\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"377.50\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"377.50\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"425.00\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"425.00\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"225.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"225.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"207.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"207.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"189.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"189.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"171.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"171.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"153.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"153.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"135.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"135.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"117.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"117.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"99.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"99.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"81.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"81.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"63.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"63.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"45.00\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"45.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"171.0\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"171.0\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"45.0\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"45.0\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polyline points=\"45.0,45.0 282.5,45.0 282.5,225.0 425.0,225.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#176b87\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"425\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\">t (s)</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"33\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"Arial\">v (m/s)</text><text x=\"45.00\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">0</text><text x=\"92.50\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1</text><text x=\"140.00\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">2</text><text x=\"187.50\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">3</text><text x=\"235.00\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">4</text><text x=\"282.50\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">5</text><text x=\"330.00\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">6</text><text x=\"377.50\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">7</text><text x=\"425.00\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">8</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"229.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">−3</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"211.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">−2</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"193.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">−1</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"175.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">0</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"157.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">1</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"139.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">2</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"121.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">3</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"103.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">4</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"85.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">5</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"67.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">6</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"49.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#5C575E\">7</text></svg></span><p>Efter t = 8 s fortsätter vagnen med hastigheten −3 m/s tills den återkommer till start. Hur många ytterligare sekunder tar det? Svara med två decimaler.</p>",
    "s": "<p>Under 0–5 s förflyttas vagnen +35 m och under 5–8 s −9 m. Kvar till start är 26 m. Det tar ytterligare 26/3 ≈ 8,67 s. Hela tiden från starten blir cirka 16,67 s.</p>",
