        "fraga": "Bestäm hela glidsträckan fram till stopp i m.",
        "t": "<p>En puck skjuts iväg över en isbana med farten 12 m/s. Friktionen mot isen gör att pucken retarderar likformigt med 0,40 m/s².</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"134\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 49.884 460.000 99.768\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"116\" width=\"432\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#DCE6F2\"/><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"116\" x2=\"446\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"102\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"26,112 36,116.6 36,107.4\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">friktion</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"180,76 170,80.6 170,71.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"135\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v₀ = 12 m/s</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"138\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">is</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm hela glidsträckan fram till stopp i m.</p>",
