    "niva": "C",
    "poang": "(1/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>Allt är i vila. Använd g = 9,82 m/s².</p><p>En mobiltelefon (200 g) ligger ovanpå en laptop (0,820 kg) på ett skrivbord. Frilägg laptopen och rita ut alla krafter som verkar på den med korrekta storlekar.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"117\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 20.796 310.000 58.407\"><rect x=\"12\" y=\"67\" width=\"286\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"67\" x2=\"298\" y2=\"67\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"41\" width=\"130\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E8DCC6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"26\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"136\" y1=\"33\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"33\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"37\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">mobil 200 g</text><line x1=\"174\" y1=\"54\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">laptop 0,820 kg</text></svg></span>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg width=\"440\" height=\"350\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 350\"><rect width=\"440\" height=\"350\" fill=\"white\"/><defs><marker id=\"laptop6\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" fill=\"#a63e30\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"155\" y=\"170\" width=\"130\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#eee\" stroke=\"#333\"/><g stroke=\"#a63e30\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#laptop6)\"><path d=\"M 180 210 V 70\"/><path d=\"M 220 190 V 302.55\"/><path d=\"M 270 170 V 197.45\"/></g><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\"><text x=\"145\" y=\"54\">N_b = 10,0 N</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"326\">F_g = 8,05 N</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"191\">N_m = 1,96 N</text><text x=\"194\" y=\"159\">laptop</text></g></svg></span><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">1</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Telefonen står stilla och trycker därför på laptopen med sin tyngd.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[N_m=m_mg=0{,}200\\cdot9{,}82=1{,}964\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">2</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Laptopens egen tyngdkraft verkar nedåt.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_g=m_Lg=0{,}820\\cdot9{,}82=8{,}052\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">3</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Bordets normalkraft måste balansera båda nedåtkrafterna.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[N_b-N_m-F_g=0\\]\\[N_b=(0{,}200+0{,}820)9{,}82=10{,}016\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> På laptopen verkar \\(1{,}96\\ \\mathrm N\\) och \\(8{,}05\\ \\mathrm N\\) nedåt samt bordets normalkraft \\(10{,}0\\ \\mathrm N\\) uppåt.</p></div>",
