    "poang": "(2/2/0)",
    "t": "<p>Kraften 48 kN är rälsens drivande kraft på loket. Bortse från rullmotstånd och luftmotstånd.</p><p>Ett lok med massan 40 ton drar två vagnar som väger 20 ton vardera. Drivkraften på loket är 48 kN framåt.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg height=\"168\" width=\"620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 52.045 520.000 141.264\"><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"154\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"58\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"86\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"114\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"142\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"142\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"198\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"226\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"254\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"254\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"282\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"282\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"338\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"338\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"366\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"394\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"394\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"422\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"422\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"450\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"478\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"478\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#9A959C\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"84\" width=\"110\" height=\"58\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E5EDF4\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"56\" y=\"92\" width=\"32\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"175\" y=\"92\" width=\"125\" height=\"50\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"325\" y=\"92\" width=\"125\" height=\"50\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"325\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"146\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"122\" cy=\"146\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"195\" cy=\"146\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"146\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"146\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"146\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"108\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">40 t</text><text x=\"237\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">20 t</text><text x=\"387\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2B2527\">20 t</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"157.5\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><polygon points=\"168,64 157.5,68.8 157.5,59.2\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"176\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F = 48 kN</text><text x=\"162\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">koppel 1</text><text x=\"312\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#5C575E\">koppel 2</text></svg></span>\n<ol><li>Hur stor massa har hela tåget?</li><li>Vilken acceleration får tåget?</li><li>Hur stor kraft drar koppel 1 med?</li><li>Hur stor kraft drar koppel 2 med? Varför är den mindre?</li></ol>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Addera lokets och vagnarnas massor.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[m_{\\mathrm{tot}}=(40+20+20)\\ \\mathrm t=80\\ \\mathrm t=8{,}0\\cdot10^4\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Dragkraften accelererar hela tåget.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[a=\\frac{48\\,000}{80\\,000}=0{,}60\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Koppel 1 måste accelerera båda vagnarna bakom loket.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_1=(20\\,000+20\\,000)0{,}60=24\\,000\\ \\mathrm N=24\\ \\mathrm{kN}\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Koppel 2 accelererar bara den sista vagnen.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F_2=20\\,000\\cdot0{,}60=12\\ \\mathrm{kN}\\]</div><p>Ju längre bak ett koppel sitter, desto mindre massa finns bakom det att accelerera.</p></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Tågets massa är \\(80\\ \\mathrm t\\) och accelerationen \\(0{,}60\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}\\). Koppel 1 belastas med \\(24\\ \\mathrm{kN}\\) och koppel 2 med \\(12\\ \\mathrm{kN}\\).</p></div>",
    "familj": "Motståndskrafter och kopplade kroppar",
    "formaga": [
      "begrepp",
      "resonemang"
    ],
