    "typ": "Kraft och hastighet",
    "poang": "(3/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>En hink med vatten dras upp ur en brunn med konstant fart.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg height=\"276\" width=\"380\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"139.800 5.394 219.600 159.432\"><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"158\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"178\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"188\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"288\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><path d=\"M 186 96 L 254 96 L 244 156 L 196 156 Z\" fill=\"#DCEAF6\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><ellipse cx=\"220\" cy=\"96\" rx=\"34\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#DCE6F2\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"126\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"330.00,76.00 334.60,86.00 325.40,86.00\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"344\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v</text></svg></span><p>Rita av figuren och sätt ut alla krafter som verkar på den markerade kroppen. Märk ut varje kraft med namn och rita pilen från rätt angreppspunkt.</p>\n<ol><li>Vilka krafter verkar på hinken?</li>\n<li>Hur stora är de i förhållande till varandra? Motivera.</li>\n<li>Hinken rör sig uppåt. Måste den resulterande kraften peka uppåt?</li></ol><p>Hinken är helt ovanför vattenytan och rör inte brunnsväggen. Frilägg hinken tillsammans med vattnet i den. Repet är lodrätt. Bortse från luftmotståndet.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg height=\"332\" width=\"380\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hink som dras med konstant fart med lika långa pilar för snörkraft och tyngdkraft.\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"139.800 3.596 219.600 192.111\"><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"158\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"178\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"188\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"288\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/><path d=\"M 186 96 L 254 96 L 244 156 L 196 156 Z\" fill=\"#EDEEF1\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><ellipse cx=\"220\" cy=\"96\" rx=\"34\" ry=\"9\" fill=\"#DCE6F2\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"126\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"330.00,76.00 334.60,86.00 325.40,86.00\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"344\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v</text><defs><marker id=\"situationspil-4-147\" markerWidth=\"8.4\" markerHeight=\"8.4\" refX=\"7.39\" refY=\"4.2\" orient=\"auto\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L8.4,4.2 L0,8.4 Z\" fill=\"#B43123\"/></marker></defs><g class=\"facit-krafter\"><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.31\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" marker-end=\"url(#situationspil-4-147)\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"96\" r=\"2.52\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"228.4\" y=\"43.65\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.55\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">S</text><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"171\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.31\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" marker-end=\"url(#situationspil-4-147)\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"126\" r=\"2.52\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"228.4\" y=\"186.75\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.55\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\">F<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"9\">g</tspan></text></g></svg></span><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">På hinken verkar snörkraften uppåt och tyngdkraften nedåt.</p></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Konstant fart innebär noll acceleration.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[S-mg=0\\Rightarrow S=mg\\]</div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Att hinken rör sig uppåt kräver inte en uppåtriktad resultant.</p><p>En uppåtriktad resultant behövs bara när dess uppåthastighet ökar.</p></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Snörkraften och tyngdkraften är lika stora; resultanten är noll.</p></div><p>Kraftpilarna i figuren visar riktningar schematiskt. Belopp och jämförelser framgår av lösningen.</p>",
    "familj": "Rita krafter vid jämvikt",
