    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "(2/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>En vagn på 2,0 kg rör sig åt höger med 3,0 m/s mot en stillastående vagn på 4,0 kg. De hakar i varandra. Höger är positiv riktning.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg height=\"302\" width=\"500\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" viewBox=\"0.000 0.000 341.543 206.000\"><text x=\"12\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Före</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"50\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"112\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"122,30 112,34.6 112,25.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">3,0 m/s</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"50\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"90\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"288\" y=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">stilla</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\">Efter</text><rect x=\"170\" y=\"150\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"188\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"188\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><rect x=\"246\" y=\"150\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"264\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"264\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"222\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><polygon points=\"270,130 260,134.6 260,125.4\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"246\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\">v = ?</text></svg></span><ol style=\"display:grid;gap:0.85rem\"><li>Bestäm total rörelsemängd före stöten. Svara i kg·m/s. Avrunda vid behov till 2 decimaler.</li><li>Bestäm den gemensamma hastigheten efter stöten. Svara i m/s. Avrunda vid behov till 2 decimaler.</li></ol>",
    "s": "<p>a) p_före = 2,0 · 3,0+4,0 · 0 = +6,0 kg·m/s. Svar: 6 kg·m/s.</p><p>b) Total rörelsemängd är 2,0 · 3,0 = 6,0 kg·m/s och massan är 6,0 kg. v = 6,0/6,0 = +1,0 m/s. Svar: 1 m/s.</p>",
