    "niva": "E",
    "poang": "(1/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>\\(0{,}220\\ \\mathrm{kg}\\) is vid \\(0\\,^\\circ\\mathrm C\\) tillförs \\(42{,}62\\ \\mathrm{kJ}\\). Hur mycket is finns kvar? Materialdata: \\(L_f=334\\ \\mathrm{kJ/kg}\\). Svara i gram.</p>",
