        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Lös ut strömmen ur samma samband.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[I=\\sqrt{\\frac PR}=\\sqrt{\\frac{20}{800}}=0{,}158\\ \\mathrm A\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(0{,}158\\ \\mathrm A\\).</p></div>",
