        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vid fyra gånger avståndet blir den en sextondel.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\dot H_4=200\\left(\\frac14\\right)^2=12{,}5\\ \\mu\\mathrm{Sv/h}\\]</div></div></div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(12{,}5\\ \\mu\\mathrm{Sv/h}\\).</p></div>",
