    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[Z_{dotter}=84-2=82\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> Atomnumret blir \\(82\\), alltså bly.</p></div>",
