    "s": "<p>\\(L_2=46\\cdot\\dfrac{101{,}3}{280}=16{,}6\\) cm. \\(\\Delta L=46-16{,}6\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(0{,}29\\) m</p>",
