        "t": "<p>En person går från origo till punkten dit pilen pekar. Pilen \\(s\\) är personens förflyttning. En ruta motsvarar 1 m.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 272.00 246.00\" width=\"272\" height=\"246\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinatsystem med rutnät. Förflyttningsvektorn s går från origo till punkten (5, −2).\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"272.00\" height=\"246.00\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"32.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"58.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"58.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"84.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"84.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"110.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"110.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"136.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"136.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"162.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"162.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"188.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"188.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"214.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"214.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"240.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"214.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"188.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"188.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"162.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"162.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"136.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"136.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"110.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"84.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"84.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"58.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"58.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"32.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"246.00\" y2=\"110.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"254.00,110.00 245.00,113.80 245.00,106.20\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"84.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"84.00\" y2=\"26.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"84.00,18.00 87.80,27.00 80.20,27.00\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"252.00\" y=\"127.00\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#2B2527\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">x</text><text x=\"72.00\" y=\"28.00\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#2B2527\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">y</text><line x1=\"84.00\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"205.64\" y2=\"158.66\" stroke=\"#293747\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"214.00,162.00 203.08,162.37 206.35,154.20\" fill=\"#293747\"/><text x=\"230.90\" y=\"173.26\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#293747\" text-anchor=\"middle\">s</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm förflyttningens y-komposant \\(s_y\\).</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Spetsen ligger 2 rutor under origo. Nedåt är negativ y-riktning.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[s_y=-2\\ \\mathrm m\\]</div></div>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Räkna rutor i x-led och i y-led från origo till spetsen. Glöm inte tecknen.</p>",
        "niva": "E",
        "traningsniva": 2,
        "arbetsinsats": 1,
        "poang": "(1/0/0)"
