        "t": "<p>En lyftkran håller i en balk med en vajer. Vajerns kraft \\(F\\) på balken visas i figuren, med balken i origo. En ruta motsvarar 1 N.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 324.00 350.00\" width=\"324\" height=\"350\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinatsystem med rutnät. Kraftvektorn F går från origo till punkten (−1, −5).\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"324.00\" height=\"350.00\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"32.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"58.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"58.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"84.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"84.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"110.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"110.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"136.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"136.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"162.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"162.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"188.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"188.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"214.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"214.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"240.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"266.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"266.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"292.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"318.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"292.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"266.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"266.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"240.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"240.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"214.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"188.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"188.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"162.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"162.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"136.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"136.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"110.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"84.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"84.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"58.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"58.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"32.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"162.00\" x2=\"298.00\" y2=\"162.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"306.00,162.00 297.00,165.80 297.00,158.20\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"162.00\" y1=\"318.00\" x2=\"162.00\" y2=\"26.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"162.00,18.00 165.80,27.00 158.20,27.00\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"304.00\" y=\"179.00\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#2B2527\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">x</text><text x=\"150.00\" y=\"28.00\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#2B2527\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">y</text><line x1=\"162.00\" y1=\"162.00\" x2=\"137.77\" y2=\"283.17\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"136.00,292.00 133.65,281.33 142.28,283.06\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"132.43\" y=\"314.35\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\" text-anchor=\"middle\">F</text></svg></span><p>Beräkna kraftens storlek \\(F\\).</p>",
        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Komposanterna är vinkelräta, så storleken ges av Pythagoras sats. Tecknen försvinner när komposanterna kvadreras.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[F=\\sqrt{(-1)^2+(-5)^2}=\\sqrt{26}\\approx 5{,}1\\ \\mathrm N\\]</div></div>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Räkna rutor från origo till spetsen i x-led och y-led. Storleken får du med Pythagoras sats.</p>",
        "niva": "E",
