    "spelIntro": "<p>En fotboll sparkas iväg med farten 18 m/s i vinkeln 35° över marken. x-axeln är vågrät och y-axeln lodrät.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 360.00 210.00\" width=\"360\" height=\"210\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hastighetsvektorn 18 m/s riktad 35° ovanför positiva x-axeln.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"360.00\" height=\"210.00\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><line x1=\"70.00\" y1=\"140.00\" x2=\"282.00\" y2=\"140.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"290.00,140.00 281.00,143.80 281.00,136.20\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"130.00\" y1=\"180.00\" x2=\"130.00\" y2=\"38.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"130.00,30.00 133.80,39.00 126.20,39.00\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"288.00\" y=\"158.00\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#2B2527\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">x</text><text x=\"117.00\" y=\"40.00\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#2B2527\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">y</text><path d=\"M176.00,140.00 A46,46 0 0 0 167.68,113.62\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5C575E\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"196.76\" y=\"123.45\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#5C575E\" text-anchor=\"middle\">35°</text><line x1=\"130.00\" y1=\"140.00\" x2=\"225.02\" y2=\"73.47\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"232.39,68.30 226.73,77.64 221.68,70.43\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"243.86\" y=\"64.77\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\" text-anchor=\"middle\">v = 18 m/s</text></svg></span>",
