    "t": "<p>Två hundar drar i samma leksak. Deras krafter \\(F_1\\) och \\(F_2\\) på leksaken visas i figuren, med leksaken i origo. En ruta motsvarar 1 N.</p><span class=\"fig smal\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 324.00 324.00\" width=\"324\" height=\"324\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinatsystem med rutnät. F₁ går från origo till (1, 4) och F₂ går från origo till (−4, 1).\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"324.00\" height=\"324.00\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"32.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"58.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"58.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"84.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"84.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"110.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"110.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"136.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"136.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"162.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"162.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"188.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"188.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"214.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"214.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"240.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"240.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"266.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"266.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"292.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"292.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"266.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"266.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"240.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"240.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"214.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"214.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"188.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"188.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"162.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"162.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"136.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"136.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"110.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"110.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"84.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"84.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"58.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"58.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"32.00\" x2=\"292.00\" y2=\"32.00\" stroke=\"#E4E3E6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"32.00\" y1=\"162.00\" x2=\"298.00\" y2=\"162.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"306.00,162.00 297.00,165.80 297.00,158.20\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"162.00\" y1=\"292.00\" x2=\"162.00\" y2=\"26.00\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"162.00,18.00 165.80,27.00 158.20,27.00\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><text x=\"304.00\" y=\"179.00\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#2B2527\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">x</text><text x=\"150.00\" y=\"28.00\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#2B2527\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">y</text><line x1=\"162.00\" y1=\"162.00\" x2=\"185.82\" y2=\"66.73\" stroke=\"#B43123\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"188.00,58.00 189.84,68.77 181.31,66.63\" fill=\"#B43123\"/><text x=\"192.41\" y=\"44.84\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#B43123\" text-anchor=\"middle\">F₁</text><line x1=\"162.00\" y1=\"162.00\" x2=\"66.73\" y2=\"138.18\" stroke=\"#2A5D9E\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"58.00,136.00 68.77,134.16 66.63,142.69\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\"/><text x=\"40.34\" y=\"136.09\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#2A5D9E\" text-anchor=\"middle\">F₂</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm riktningen för resultanten \\(F_R=F_1+F_2\\). Ange riktningen som vinkeln \\(v\\) från positiva x-axeln, räknad moturs (mellan 0° och 360°).</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Addera krafterna komposantvis: \\(F_R=(1+(-4),\\,4+(1))=(-3,\\,5)\\ \\mathrm N\\).</p><p class=\"facit-metod\">Räkna först ut den spetsiga vinkeln \\(\\alpha\\) mellan vektorn och x-axeln med tangens. Använd komposanternas storlekar utan tecken.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\tan\\alpha=\\frac{|F_R_y|}{|F_R_x|}=\\frac{5}{3}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\alpha=59{,}0^\\circ\\]</div><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vektorn pekar snett uppåt vänster. Då är \\(\\alpha\\) vinkeln mot negativa x-axeln, och riktningen blir \\(180^\\circ-\\alpha\\).</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[v=180^\\circ-59{,}0^\\circ=121{,}0^\\circ\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(v\\approx 121^\\circ\\).</p><p class=\"facit-not\">Resultantens riktning kan inte fås genom att medelvärdesbilda krafternas vinklar. Den beror också på hur stora krafterna är.</p></div>",
