    "poang": "(1/0/0)",
    "t": "<p>En vagn startar från vila. Diagrammet visar dess acceleration.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"460\" height=\"270\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"a-t-diagram: 1,5 m/s² från 0 till 4 s, därefter 0\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"white\"/><line x1=\"52.00\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"52.00\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"113.33\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"113.33\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"174.67\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"174.67\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"236.00\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"236.00\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"297.33\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"297.33\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"358.67\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"358.67\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"420.00\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"420.00\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"220.00\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"220.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"174.00\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"174.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"128.00\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"128.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"82.00\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"82.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"36.00\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"36.00\" stroke=\"#CFCDD2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"220.0\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"220.0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><line x1=\"52\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"/><polyline points=\"52.0,82.0 297.3,82.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#176b87\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polyline points=\"297.3,220.0 420.0,220.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#176b87\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"258\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">t (s)</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\">a (m/s²)</text><text x=\"52.00\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">0</text><text x=\"113.33\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">1</text><text x=\"174.67\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">2</text><text x=\"236.00\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">3</text><text x=\"297.33\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">4</text><text x=\"358.67\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">5</text><text x=\"420.00\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">6</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"224.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">0</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"178.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">0,5</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"132.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">1</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"86.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">1,5</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"40.00\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"12\"  fill=\"#5C575E\">2</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm vagnens hastighet vid t = 4 s.</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p class=\"facit-metod\">Vagnen startar från vila, så hastigheten vid 4 s är lika med arean under grafen från 0 till 4 s.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[v=0+1{,}5\\cdot4=6{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(6{,}0\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\\).</p></div>",
