        "s": "<p>Retardation \\(9{,}82(0{,}98\\cos9{,}0^\\circ-\\sin9{,}0^\\circ)\\).</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(111\\) m</p>",
        "ledtrad": "<p>Tyngdkomposanten motverkar inbromsningen.</p>",
        "niva": "C",
        "poang": "(0/1/0)",
